# Event Loop Visualization

## Visual Priorities

- **Active phase** — visually highlight (background, border, pulse)
- **Current task** — highlight item in queue
- **Microtasks** — separate block between phases (nextTick, Promise)
- **Flow arrows** — show loop direction (Timers → Pending → Poll → Check → Close → back to Timers)

## Interactivity

- Buttons: **Step** (next step), **Reset**, **Play** (auto run)
- Ability to add demo tasks (setTimeout, setImmediate) and see the result
- Do not block UI: all animations via requestAnimationFrame or CSS transitions

## Accessibility and Readability

- Contrasting colors for phases
- Short labels for elements (tooltip on hover)
- Optional dark theme support

## Performance

- Avoid creating new objects in render unnecessarily
- Animations: CSS `transition` preferred over JS animations for simple cases
